#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn how to install snap on Debian with APT, update to the latest release, "
"resolve feature requirements, and verify it with hello-world."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:8
msgid "Install snap on Debian"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:10
msgid "On Debian, snap can be installed directly from the command line:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:12
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:16
msgid ""
"If the *sudo* command isn't installed (usually because a root password was "
"provided at install time), you can install *snap* by first switching to the "
"*root* account:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:18
msgid ""
"$ su root\n"
"# apt update\n"
"# apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:24
msgid ""
"**Either log out and back in again, or restart your system, to ensure snap’s "
"paths are updated correctly.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:26
msgid ""
"After this, install the `snapd` snap in order to get the latest `snapd`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:28
msgid "sudo snap install snapd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:32
msgid ""
"ⓘ  Note: some snaps require new snapd features and will show an error such "
"as `snap \"lxd\" assumes unsupported features\"` during install. You can "
"solve this issue by making sure the core snap is installed (`snap install "
"core`) and it's the latest version (`snap refresh core`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:34
msgid ""
"To test your system, install the [hello-world](https://snapcraft.io/hello-"
"world) snap and make sure it runs correctly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:36
msgid ""
"$ sudo snap install hello-world\n"
"hello-world 6.3 from Canonical✓ installed\n"
"$ hello-world\n"
"Hello World!\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/debian.md:43
msgid "Snap is now installed and ready to go!"
msgstr ""
